# Artifact Secret Hygiene self-test suites — extensive test coverage required
# =============================================================================
# These files have comprehensive self-tests that require inline test cases.
#
# RATIONALE FOR EXEMPTIONS:
# - go_parser_tests.py: Contains embedded Go AST parser (300+ lines), validation
#   logic, and 15+ test functions. The Go parser IS the test infrastructure;
#   splitting would create circular dependency between test and parser modules.
# - positive_tests.py: 30+ test functions for query param detection, JWT,
#   cookies, etc. All tests import from rules/scanner modules; splitting would
#   require cross-module imports reducing test isolation.
#
# These exemptions are justified because the files are cohesive single-responsibility
# modules with comprehensive test coverage. The line count is a natural consequence
# of thorough testing, not poor organization.
scripts/uvb76_artifact_secret_hygiene/tests/go_parser_tests.py  # Test infrastructure with embedded Go AST parser; circular dependency if split
scripts/uvb76_artifact_secret_hygiene/tests/positive_tests.py  # 30+ cohesive test functions; splitting reduces test isolation
scripts/uvb76_artifact_secret_hygiene/tests/self_test.py  # Self-test runner aggregating the complete artifact-hygiene contract suite

